Comment: 0,0:08:51.01,0:08:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.37,0:00:10.20,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,250)}I think it's time to blow this scene
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.20,0:00:12.48,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,250)}Get everybody and their stuff together
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.48,0:00:14.99,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,0)}Okay, three, two, one let's jam
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.38,0:01:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,This was the most special of the special.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.37,0:01:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It was an emergency ration\Nfor true emergencies
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.49,0:01:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,that was saved for\Nthe last of the last resorts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.76,0:02:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,All I'm asking is who ate this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.29,0:02:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Grudges over food sure are scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.39,0:02:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Spike, by perchance, was it you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.82,0:02:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If I was the culprit, I wouldn't leave\Nthe empty box lying around like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.78,0:02:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Ed is hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.77,0:02:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you ate it yourself,\Nbut are pretending
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.96,0:02:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,to be upset because\Nwe found the empty box?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.97,0:02:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.32,0:02:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't had anything to eat\Nfor two whole days!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.23,0:02:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you call a situation\Nlike this an emergency?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.24,0:02:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna eat stuff like\Nfried bifun noodles...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.50,0:02:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We're outta gas!\NWe can't do anything about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.54,0:02:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If you could hold out\Nlike this a bit longer,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.54,0:02:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll reach Europa soon\Nthanks to inertia.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.09,0:02:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Tummy's caving in!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.47,0:02:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If only we could use that\Nenergy to propel ourselves...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.92,0:02:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You keep mouthing off like that and\NI'll toss you out into absolute zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.51,0:02:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And a stir-fry of liver and\Nchives would be good, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.31,0:02:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds good. At least it's better than\Naimlessly floating around this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.61,0:03:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That was some collision...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.24,0:03:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Can you hear me? Answer me! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.74,0:03:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't this...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.53,0:03:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,a hit-and-run?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.58,0:03:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad! The shock from that\Ncollision changed our trajectory!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.96,0:03:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What did what to who?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.42,0:03:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.26,0:04:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.56,0:04:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow... Where is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.56,0:04:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,This is so uncivilized!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.77,0:04:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think that's our problem...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.07,0:04:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to start by checking the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.61,0:04:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you go get some food?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.35,0:04:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.19,0:04:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I suddenly feel... a stabbing pain...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.99,0:04:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to pull?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.19,0:04:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,This expired a year ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.64,0:04:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I didn't eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.85,0:04:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Serves you right. This is divine retribution!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.50,0:04:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get to it...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.26,0:05:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatcha gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.49,0:05:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ed will help, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.06,0:05:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We're fine here, so go outside\Nand find us some food.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.50,0:05:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.38,0:05:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta wear my socks
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.26,0:05:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,to go out, to go out...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.94,0:06:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing here...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.36,0:06:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that hit-and-run ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.83,0:06:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.46,0:06:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait!!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.46,0:06:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.92,0:06:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Smell... {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.88,0:06:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Smell... food...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.74,0:06:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Food!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.62,0:06:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Gimme!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.82,0:06:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,1,000 woolongs each, including tax.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.01,0:06:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Cash only. No money cards\Nor cash cards allowed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.09,0:06:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have money.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.00,0:07:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Then hurry home, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.00,0:07:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I have one?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.98,0:07:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,1,000 woolongs each. Cash only. Cards are...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.12,0:07:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Kid, no use staring.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.28,0:07:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want food, go someplace like the town.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.16,0:07:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need change.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.85,0:07:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,In exchange...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.81,0:07:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If you see this man, gimme a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.28,0:07:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.98,0:08:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.45,0:08:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We would like to check your baggage.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.46,0:08:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.16,0:08:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently, a broker on\Nthe wanted list for
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.32,0:08:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,illegal mushroom sales\Nmade a getaway to this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.12,0:08:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.44,0:08:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm after that bounty as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.20,0:08:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,A cowboy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.29,0:08:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna check out your trunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.80,0:08:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, feel free.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.59,0:08:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.60,0:08:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.81,0:08:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,N-Now, wait a minute...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.81,0:08:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, stay still.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.89,0:08:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know anything about this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.89,0:08:48.05,Default - Overlap,,0,0,0,,Turn around! Hands on the ground! {9 frames?}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.05,0:08:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.05,0:08:52.27,Default - Overlap,,0,0,0,,Now put your hands on the ground! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.67,0:08:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.33,0:08:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Food, food, do you have any?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.03,0:09:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you don't? Oh, you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.16,0:09:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Boy, am I hungry...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.76,0:09:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Meanie!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.16,0:09:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.42,0:09:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Gimme!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.43,0:09:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Gimme something!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.53,0:09:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, stop hanging all over me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.73,0:09:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.17,0:09:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you tell me you\Nforgot who I am, Domino!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.03,0:09:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see... {10 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.73,0:09:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! Remember, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.58,0:09:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the younger of the Shaft brothers\Nthat bought mushrooms from you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.81,0:09:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I really can't recall...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.38,0:09:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You do want to know why I drag an\Nempty coffin around like this, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.91,0:09:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's because...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.12,0:09:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go home after\Nputting your corpse inside—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.66,0:09:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Pieces... All in pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.42,0:09:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What was what to who?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.92,0:09:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,My big bro ate a mushroom\Nhe bought from you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.68,0:10:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,and laughed and laughed\Nand twisted his intestines to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.38,0:10:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,A happy way to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.10,0:10:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.57,0:10:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, it's all your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.66,0:10:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I call an unjust resentment!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.78,0:10:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ed is hungry, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.13,0:10:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.21,0:10:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you bastard! Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.32,0:10:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Food!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.57,0:10:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Aah! Don't, Ein! We have to share!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.18,0:10:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ein?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.64,0:10:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad mushroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.68,0:11:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.02,0:11:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.81,0:11:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This really can't be happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.91,0:11:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Really... This really has no way of happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.35,0:13:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey... You know, the world\Nreally is a great place...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.51,0:13:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I just say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.14,0:13:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.55,0:13:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a stairway to heaven.\NYou know that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.75,0:13:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,An obnoxious little frog...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.79,0:13:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,See if I care. I warned you! {original: "I don't care anymore. I warned you!"}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.30,0:14:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.02,0:14:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I now know the secrets of the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.27,0:14:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.96,0:14:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,who was I?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.84,0:14:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So these mushrooms are\Ninedible after all...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.66,0:14:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So, as you can tell, it's time for\Nanother episode of Big Shot!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.39,0:14:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We'll introduce you to more{\i0}\N{\i1}and more bounties this week!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.73,0:14:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So, batting first for us today...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.99,0:14:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...is this man, Domino Walker.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.82,0:14:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's currently wanted for{\i0}\N{\i1}selling illegal mushrooms.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.32,0:14:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The bounty is a conservative 1.2 mil.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.32,0:14:52.93,Default - Overlap,,0,0,0,,Nya! That's the guy we just saw!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.93,0:14:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That's cowgirl, Ein.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.25,0:14:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We earn money, and buy food!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.73,0:15:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ein, you're a cow-woofwoof!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.19,0:15:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.94,0:15:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,One!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.68,0:15:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.49,0:15:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Five!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.24,0:15:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Four!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.09,0:15:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.79,0:15:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't underestimate the police!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.08,0:15:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I really don't know anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.18,0:15:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why did you have a strange kid\Nand a dog in the trunk of your car?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.32,0:15:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello... Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.01,0:15:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you, Sally.\NReally... You're so hopeless...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.36,0:15:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you so many times\Nnot to call me at work...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.44,0:15:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And? Yeah yeah, and that's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.03,0:15:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I didn't mean it {\i1}that{\i0} way\Nwhen I said "that's it?"...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.40,0:15:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, like that. I love you, Sally.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.08,0:15:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it. Tonight at 7 it is. Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.60,0:16:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.63,0:16:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, young'un?\NLookin' like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.15,0:16:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Did your woman run off without you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.54,0:16:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.63,0:16:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,None of your business, old geezers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.15,0:16:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man... that's for eating all at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.53,0:16:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,They say when you're in a hurry, go around.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.32,0:16:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.37,0:16:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not here...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.54,0:16:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Aah! That hit-and-run ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.34,0:16:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they never even dreamed\Nthat I was raising these in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.98,0:16:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This one's bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.89,0:17:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, making an emergency landing here\Nwas the only miscalculation I had.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.25,0:17:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you surprised?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.57,0:17:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.09,0:17:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.40,0:17:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.67,0:17:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my line! How did you\Nget in here in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.06,0:17:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The door was open.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.63,0:17:15.36,Default - Overlap,,0,0,0,,Is that so?! {extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.36,0:17:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Culprit of the hit-and-run,\Nprepare to get arrested!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.07,0:17:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Stink bug gas!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.45,0:17:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.59,0:18:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't think that you can get away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.67,0:18:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get in my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.55,0:19:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ein! Growl!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.93,0:19:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,C-Come on! Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.29,0:19:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Boo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.23,0:19:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.01,0:19:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.56,0:19:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-These mushrooms are\Nworth 100,000 each.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.72,0:19:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go, and I'll give them to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.99,0:19:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.65,0:19:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about which one is worth more.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.04,0:19:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I dunno.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.90,0:20:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,A-Are you an idiot?! {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.78,0:20:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Take the mushrooms!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.31,0:20:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 2,0:20:10.36,0:20:11.86,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\c&HCCCCCC&\fax-0.17\fs65.8\b1\i1\fnUDDigiKyoWriting Web\blur0.5\i1\pos(1086.333,1053.6)}Thanks.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:10.36,0:20:11.86,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs65.8\1a&FE&\fax-0.17\shad3\b1\i1\c&HCCCCCC&\fnUDDigiKyoWriting Web\blur0.8\pos(1086.333,1053.6)}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.36,0:20:11.86,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs65.8\1a&FE&\4a&be&\fax-0.17\shad4.5\b1\i1\c&HCCCCCC&\fnUDDigiKyoWriting Web\blur0.8\pos(1086.333,1053.6)}Thanks.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:11.86,0:20:13.69,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\c&HCCCCCC&\fax-0.17\fs65.8\b1\i1\fnUDDigiKyoWriting Web\blur0.5\i1\pos(430.6,1047.2)}Oh, it's no problem.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:11.86,0:20:13.69,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs65.8\1a&FE&\fax-0.17\shad3\b1\i1\c&HCCCCCC&\fnUDDigiKyoWriting Web\blur0.8\pos(430.6,1047.2)}Oh, it's no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.86,0:20:13.69,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs65.8\1a&FE&\4a&be&\fax-0.17\shad4.5\b1\i1\c&HCCCCCC&\fnUDDigiKyoWriting Web\blur0.8\pos(430.6,1047.2)}Oh, it's no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.85,0:20:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yahoo! Dinner! Mushroom!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.38,0:20:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,100,000 each? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.94,0:20:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That sure would make some money.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.58,0:20:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,These are real?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.14,0:20:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.56,0:20:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm with the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.16,0:20:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to ask a few questions about\NDomino, an illegal mushroom dealer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.34,0:20:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, we have no clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.42,0:20:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry we can't be of any help.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.69,0:21:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Ed knows who that i— {snap to end keyframe or end just before her mouth gets covered?}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.77,0:21:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mind her...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.85,0:21:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,In exchange, I got—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.66,0:21:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Really...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.51,0:21:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a troublesome kid...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.53,0:21:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, sir. {extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.74,0:21:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,They're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.97,0:21:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He must really like shiitake mushrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.17,0:21:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, sorry to bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.18,0:21:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.88,0:21:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the menu?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.25,0:21:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,shiitake stir-fry, shiitake stew,\Nshiitake salad, and a shiitake dessert.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.22,0:21:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaaaaaay!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.71,0:21:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Again? How many days has it been?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.44,0:21:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No... I can't eat anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.45,0:22:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit complaining, and be\Nthankful that we can even eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.94,0:22:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Thankful!
